: 7 stocks held by 100+ MF schemes in October rally up to 300% in FY27]]> </title><description><![CDATA[An ETMarkets analysis identified seven stocks held by over 100 mutual fund schemes that have more than doubled in FY27 so far. Sterlite Technologies led with 303% gains, followed by Welspun Corp, Ather Energy and Laurus Labs.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/mutlibaggers-7-stocks-held-by-100-mf-schemes-in-october-rally-up-to-300-in-fy27/slideshow/135802136.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135801544,imgsize-2860.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/mutlibaggers-7-stocks-held-by-100-mf-schemes-in-october-rally-up-to-300-in-fy27/slideshow/135802136.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:05:39 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jagatjit Industries Q2 net loss narrows to Rs 4 cr, revenue rises 90%]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Jagatjit Industries Ltd has reported a net loss of Rs 3.96 crore for the second quarter of FY27, significantly improving from Rs 27.91 crore lost during the same period last year. Total income surged to Rs 195.43 crore, up from Rs 103.11 crore. In the first half of FY27, the company posted an overall net loss of Rs 12.23 crore, a decrease from Rs 37.81 crore.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/jagatjit-industries-q2-net-loss-narrows-to-rs-4-cr-revenue-rises-90/articleshow/135801327.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135801327,imgsize-22754.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/earnings/jagatjit-industries-q2-net-loss-narrows-to-rs-4-cr-revenue-rises-90/articleshow/135801327.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:01:30 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[MSCI rejig: Which stocks may see the biggest inflows &amp; outflows?]]> </title><description><![CDATA[In a significant update, MSCI has revealed modifications to its indices, impacting several Indian stocks starting November 30. This shift is predicted to boost India's representation within the MSCI Emerging Markets Index. Notable stocks like Coforge and LIC are anticipated to attract considerable investments, while PI Industries may experience a decline. ]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/msci-rejig-which-stocks-may-see-the-biggest-inflows-amp-outflows/slideshow/135792280.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135792065,imgsize-38566.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/msci-rejig-which-stocks-may-see-the-biggest-inflows-amp-outflows/slideshow/135792280.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:36:12 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Asian Paints Share Price Highlights: Asian Paints Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/asian-paints-share-price-today-live-updates-13-nov-2026/liveblog/135789396.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135789396,imgsize-28552.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/asian-paints-share-price-today-live-updates-13-nov-2026/liveblog/135789396.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:00:39 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Aditya Birla Capital among 9 stocks showing White Marubozu Pattern]]> </title><description><![CDATA[On November 12, nine stocks in the Nifty500 that rose over 5.5% appeared on the ‘White Marubozu’ bullish scanner, according to StockEdge’s technical scan data. A White Marubozu is a bullish candlestick pattern in technical analysis that occurs when the opening price is the lowest for a given period, and the closing price is the highest.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/aditya-birla-capital-among-9-stocks-showing-white-marubozu-pattern/slideshow/135788959.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135788725,imgsize-208824.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/aditya-birla-capital-among-9-stocks-showing-white-marubozu-pattern/slideshow/135788959.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:21:41 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[One97 Communications among 3 stocks closing above VWAP]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Three Nifty500 stocks closed more than 2% above their respective volume-weighted average prices on November 12, according to StockEdge’s technical scan.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/one97-communications-among-3-stocks-closing-above-vwap/slideshow/135788620.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135788552,imgsize-250619.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/one97-communications-among-3-stocks-closing-above-vwap/slideshow/135788620.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:14:54 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Godrej Industries among 4 stocks showing RSI trending up]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Four Nifty500 stocks that gained over 7% on November 12 featured in StockEdge’s RSI Trending Up scan, with their Relative Strength Index (RSI) crossing above 50 from below, signalling strengthening price momentum.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/godrej-industries-among-4-stocks-showing-rsi-trending-up/slideshow/135788392.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-135788220,imgsize-259029.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/godrej-industries-among-4-stocks-showing-rsi-trending-up/slideshow/135788392.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:06:57 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDAT